# Pulsar MVP Guardrails

- Build for iPhone-first focus sessions where leaving app during focus destabilizes session.
- Keep break flow permissive and return flow intentional.
- Never auto-start focus after break completion.
- Treat notifications as supportive nudges, not enforcement.
- Keep implementation aligned with guest mode and local-first storage.
- Reject or defer out-of-scope features (accounts, sync, desktop companion, task AI).

# Decision Priority

When trade-offs appear, prioritize:
1) behavior correctness, 2) user agency, 3) emotional tone, 4) implementation simplicity.
